// Windows resource script for the portable app.
//
// Resource id 1 is the application icon: Explorer, the Start menu, and pinned
// shortcuts read the lowest-numbered icon in the PE image. The icon a running
// window shows comes from SDL_SetWindowIcon instead (AppWindow.applyIcon).
//
// Compile with rc.exe, which scripts\fetch-sdk.ps1 does:
//     rc /nologo /fo Resources\CollimationCamera.res Resources\CollimationCamera.rc
// The .res is gitignored; the release link embeds it.

1 ICON "AppIcon.ico"
